        "lines": [
          "Psalm 54"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer for Defense against Enemies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the music director; on stringed instruments. A Maskil of David, when the Ziphites came and said to Saul, “Is David not keeping himself hidden among us?”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Save me, God, by Your name,",
          "And vindicate me by Your power."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hear my prayer, God;",
          "Listen to the words of my mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For strangers have risen against me",
          "And violent men have sought my life;",
          "They have not set God before them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Behold, God is my helper;",
          "The Lord is the sustainer of my soul."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He will pay back the evil to my enemies;",
          "Destroy them in Your faithfulness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Willingly I will sacrifice to You;",
          "I will praise Your name, Lord, for it is good."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For He has saved me from all trouble,",
          "And my eye has looked with satisfaction upon my enemies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
